import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro'; import {SITE} from '../lib/config';
---
<StaticPage title="Corrections" deck="Tell the newsroom when an OGCTV report needs to be corrected or clarified." eyebrow="Accountability"><h2>Request a correction</h2><p>Send a WhatsApp message to <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsappIntl}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Correction request for OGCTV: Story link:  Issue: ')}`}><strong>{SITE.whatsapp}</strong></a>. Include the story link, the specific statement you believe is wrong, the correct information and any supporting evidence.</p><h2>What happens next</h2><p>The newsroom should review the original reporting and supporting evidence, contact relevant sources where needed, and update the article if a correction is warranted. Material corrections should be noted on the article. Minor typographical fixes that do not alter meaning may be made without a note.</p><h2>Complaints</h2><p>For a broader editorial complaint, explain the concern clearly and include a reliable way to reach you. OGCTV will not invent response deadlines before a formal newsroom policy is adopted.</p></StaticPage>
